  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><div>Bahmni supports two ways of managing Radiology workflows:</div><ul><li><p>Via Manual Radiology Upload</p></li><li>Using PACS Integration*<br /><br /></li></ul><div>*Picture Archiving and Communication System (PACS) is a medical imaging technology which provides storage and convenient access to radiology &nbsp;images from multiple imaging equipments. The images are transmitted digitally from the imaging devices and can be seen using a DICOM image viewer which could be native or web based.</div><div><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Used By</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The orders are usually placed by doctors and sometimes by other staff on behalf of the doctor based on pre-decided protocols. The radiology images are seen by Doctors for diagnostic purposes.&nbsp;</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">How is it Used?</span></h2><p>Bahmni supports both PACS integration and manual upload of radiology images. Please refer to the links below for the steps involved in managing Radiology workflows using Bahmni.</p><ul><li><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"PACS Integration and Support\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Using PACS Integration]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></li><li><p><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Upload Radiology Documents\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Via Radiology Upload]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></p></li></ul></div></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0add60ca-db50-405a-bfd6-90945fbc2b0b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Radiology and PACS\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Radiology and PACS - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"3fe3feef-06ea-4aac-b9a1-a6bbe83b0bec\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Implemnentation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Radiology and PACS Integration\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Radiology and PACS - Implementer's Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
